{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kafein</strong> is a cafe simulator game with role-playing elements about a girl and her peculiarly attached luwak pet as they manage and run a cafe deep inside the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse in a cute and youthful story around managing and running a cafe with friends you'll make along the way, including a catgirl, a witch, a deergirl, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promote the cafe, invite various customers, and get to know them well by learning their unique preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the hard-earned cash to renovate, improve, and customize the decrepit cafe and its surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world, interact with its denizens, and harvest its bountiful resources for ingredients (or ask the locals nicely).</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4123940?t=1762765212","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4123940?t=1762765212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123940/59d8b65d8b01de086643c1bb6777ca6790430e33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762765212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123940/59d8b65d8b01de086643c1bb6777ca6790430e33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762765212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kafein</strong> is a cafe simulator game with role-playing elements about a girl and her peculiarly attached luwak pet as they manage and run a cafe deep inside the moun